/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed401141254/4/prompt.md:129:  color every bar-length cells into the blank side without overwriting earlier paint.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed401141254/4/prompt.md:130:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed401141254/4/prompt.md:131:Key insight: Each bar's length is the period for its extension, and nearer bars claim target cells first.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed401141254/4/prompt.md:132:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed401141254/4/prompt.md:133:</reference_puzzle>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed401141254/4/prompt.md:134:
